line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo da 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o adapta-se a todos os perfis de corredores e caminhantes: a prova rainha <strong>UTSM 100 km<\/strong>, o desafio por etapas <strong>ADSM 75 km<\/strong> (dividido em 3 etapas ao longo dos tr\u00eas dias), o <strong>TLSM 50 km<\/strong> (Trail Longo), o <strong>TCSM 25 km<\/strong> (Trail Curto), o <strong>TSSM 15 km<\/strong> (Trail Sprint), a <strong>Corrida Experience 10 km<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong> e o <strong>UTSM Kids<\/strong> para os futuros campe\u00f5es do trail. Os percursos cruzam paisagens deslumbrantes do <strong>Parque Natural da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede<\/strong>, estendendo-se pelos concelhos de <strong>Portalegre<\/strong>, <strong>Castelo de Vide<\/strong> e <strong>Marv\u00e3o<\/strong>, entre cristas quartz\u00edticas, bosques de castanheiros, cal\u00e7adas medievais e miradouros naturais de fronteira.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>ACP \u2013 Atletismo Clube de Portalegre<\/strong>, clube fundado em 1991 e refer\u00eancia incontorn\u00e1vel na dinamiza\u00e7\u00e3o do atletismo e do trail running no distrito de Portalegre, o <strong>Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede 2027<\/strong> alia rigor t\u00e9cnico, hospitalidade alentejana e um forte compromisso solid\u00e1rio e ambiental. Consulta abaixo o quadro das oito provas confirmadas para 2027 e acompanha a abertura das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e a publica\u00e7\u00e3o do regulamento oficial. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 a 25 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Portalegre<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing