-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 a 25 Abr<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data confirmada da 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede (UTSM 2027) realiza-se oficialmente de 23 a 25 de abril de 2027 (sexta-feira a domingo), em Portalegre.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e dist\u00e2ncias confirmadas no UTSM 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 conta com oito desafios para todos os n\u00edveis: UTSM 100 km (a prova rainha), ADSM 75 km (disputado em 3 etapas), TLSM 50 km, TCSM 25 km, TSSM 15 km, Corrida Experience 10 km, UTSM Kids (para os jovens atletas) e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem centro nevr\u00e1lgico na cidade de Portalegre (distrito de Portalegre) e percorre os trilhos do Parque Natural da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede, atravessando a regi\u00e3o de Portalegre, Castelo de Vide e Marv\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando abrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e onde consultar o regulamento e os hor\u00e1rios de 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data de 23 a 25 de abril de 2027 e as dist\u00e2ncias da 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 s\u00e3o oficiais. O regulamento definitivo de 2027, os hor\u00e1rios individuais de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia e a tabela de pre\u00e7os por fases ser\u00e3o publicados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o aquando da abertura oficial das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es em utsm.pt.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo ACP \u2013 Atletismo Clube de Portalegre, associa\u00e7\u00e3o fundada em 1991 e pioneira na cria\u00e7\u00e3o de provas de ultra trail com mais de 100 km em Portugal continental.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-23\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Portalegre\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Portalegre\", \"addressRegion\": \"Portalegre\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Ultra Trail da Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede 2027 realiza-se de 23 a 25 de abril em Portalegre. Provas de 100 km, 75 km, 50 km, 25 km, 15 km, 10 km, Kids e Caminhada!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ultra-trail-sao-mamede-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/utsm.pt\/\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/sc